            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided is an X-ray device that is equipped with: a target that generates X-rays as electrons collide therewith or pass therethrough; a filament that emits the electrons to the target; a housing that has the filament therein; and a first holding member that holds, on the outside of the housing, the portion of the target disposed outside the housing.</p>
